  "details": "In recent months things.\nThere are currently following scenario.\n\nThe name of the world list is \"Playlist1-3\" instead of the name you named.\n\nFrom which side the title of the world list will go to the editor of the first world, not the second or third world.\n\nWhen you join the world's favorite list option or edit the world list, the name is sometimes not renamed but the name of \"Playlist\".\n\nThere will be no stars in the list of favorite worlds, but they will remain on the list.\nWhen clicked, it will be presented in a way that has not yet been added to the favorites list.\n\nUnable to remove the world that has been locked or not found on the list.\n\nThe world that used to join the favorite has suddenly disappeared from the list and will occupy the list field until it finds the world and rejoins the list.\nIt is not possible to zero the field by clearing the list function before this.\nEven if you add some worlds to your favorite list and then delete them, you will only delete the newly joined world. \nThe world that is not displayed on the list still exists.\n\nWhen the world list is read, the title of the empty list will be displayed in a short time.",
